WEBVTT

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:00.737
when there exists no other path forward.

00:04:01.681 --> 00:04:04.007
The other thing I learned
in doing this work

00:04:04.031 --> 00:04:06.118
is that people engage
in productive conflict

00:04:06.142 --> 00:04:09.957
when they care about their jobs
and their coworkers.

00:04:09.981 --> 00:04:12.011
Now, that surprised me at first.

00:04:12.035 --> 00:04:14.940
I expected the worst jobs,
the worst workplaces,

00:04:14.964 --> 00:04:17.526
to have the most
employee activism on our site,

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.114
but the opposite is often true.

00:04:20.836 --> 00:04:25.614
When we come together,
we can accomplish great things.

00:04:25.638 --> 00:04:27.223
At one company,

00:04:27.247 --> 00:04:30.062
there are more than 50 campaigns
by employees there